WEBVTT

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:15.340
Rinayo, move that rock.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.810
Rinacchi, the rails are missing
down that way. Go add some.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:21.770
You bet.

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.480
There you go.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:26.520
And there.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:29.690
Umph!

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:42.540
I'm excited to leave the island,

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:45.710
but this island is full
of interesting things too.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:51.630
But more than anything, this train
and Midori-san are so intriguing.

00:00:52.050 --> 00:00:54.300
I'm going to ask Ritsu-san about this...

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:56.050
Rinaji will keep watch.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:57.800
Oops.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:02.810
I can't see! I really want to see!

00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.140
Please, let me see what's going on.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:08.610
You'll have to beat me first.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:17.740
We're safe for the time being.
No big bugs for now.

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:21.370
But there's some red fog
here and there. Be careful.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:22.950
Got it.

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:24.580
Are you okay, Sis?

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.920
I'm perfectly fine.
I'm feeling great today.

00:01:30.710 --> 00:01:34.460
Midori-chan is happy to be able
to go on a walk again.

00:01:36.220 --> 00:01:39.720
I hope we find some water
for Midori-chan too.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.520
We'll get to the wall in no time.

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.600
It's been such a long time.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:46.730
You're right.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:50.400
We always have trouble at Island Two.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:55.150
Remember the first time?
How Riku-chan immediately fell down?

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:56.530
Yeah.

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:58.660
She was really careless.

00:01:59.530 --> 00:02:02.490
And Rina-chan ate something strange
and couldn't move.

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:06.080
She's still the same
as when she was alone.

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:11.670
This might be our last expedition.

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:13.420
There you go again.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:17.380
We'll make it to Island Six,
and we'll find lots of water.

00:02:18.050 --> 00:02:19.130
But...

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:23.010
You never know what might happen
outside the island.

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.850
Somebody always...right by my side.

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.680
It might happen again...

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.230
Don't worry.

00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:36.280
It's always been tough, but your decisions
have led us the right way.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.610
It'll go well this time too.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:41.320
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:43.370
Okay, I won't.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:51.170
Inside the dark my heartbeat echoes

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:58.050
Long night will continue on

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:01.640
Time to face the hell that surrounds you
Before you crash and burn

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:04.930
Within the fire
Your soul will rise now

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:24.490
Breathe in, breathe out
Your blank gaze on the brink of life

00:03:24.910 --> 00:03:31.160
Step hard on the accelerator now
Escape the tunnel and overtake that pain

00:03:31.330 --> 00:03:38.210
A shadow disappears into smoke

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:46.050
Lost light will continue on tomorrow

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:53.150
Someday our world will change
Inside a fantasy Remember, remember

00:03:53.350 --> 00:04:00.280
I will mercilessly break your dream
and steal it away, with these hands

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:06.620
Until this body breaks
Beyond the limit We'll never surrender

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:10.330
Endless agony

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.870
Finding my life in the KEMURIKUSA

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:17.460
Ugh, there!

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:23.840
Wow, it's so totally vast!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:30.470
There really are so many things
outside the island.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.100
-That's right.
-Even more things beyond Island Two.

00:04:34.270 --> 00:04:35.690
I see.

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:38.690
The fog? Cloud? It's so dense.

00:04:38.980 --> 00:04:42.490
What's that?
It moved a little bit over there.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:44.910
You're so noisy, Wakaba.

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.950
Is it like this
everywhere outside the island?

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.490
We'll see land in a little bit.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:55.370
Some islands are connected by land,
but others you have to cross like this.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:57.830
I see how it is.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:01.510
Rinaji is smart,
so she knows things like that.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:04.550
Good to know. Impressive.

00:05:04.760 --> 00:05:05.590
Yup.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:08.390
I'm older than you,
so I'll teach you a lot.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.720
Please do! Thank you.

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:15.310
This road is incredible too.
Are they railroad tracks?

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:20.610
Good question, Wakaba.
Rina made these tracks.

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:23.030
That's amazing.

00:05:23.240 --> 00:05:24.990
Yup, we're amazing.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.780
You can say that again.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.780
This is incredible.

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:33.500
The tracks go on forever.
Must've taken a long time.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:38.120
The Rina-sans made it, so that means
it has to do with Kemurikusa too?

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:40.090
That's amazing.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.260
Moving along it with Ritsu-san's roots
and this car.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:46.260
Everything works so well together.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:08.660
Thank you so much.
I thought I was going to die.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.490
What, you wish to die now?

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:15.620
N-No, of course not!
I totally want to live. I love living!

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:22.500
Thank you...

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:26.760
I was surprised because it was red below.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.170
I'll be careful.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:31.140
Come to think of it,
you can see the red fog?

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:32.890
You have good eyes, Wakaba.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:35.770
But you almost fell. You're so dumb.

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:38.690
Don't try anything funny.

00:06:38.850 --> 00:06:42.560
The red fog is everywhere here.
I could exterminate you easily.

00:06:48.650 --> 00:06:52.070
Huh? The tracks are at an end.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:57.830
We have to walk a bit from here.
Leave it to Midori-chan.

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:06.300
Are we outside the island now?

00:07:06.500 --> 00:07:08.090
Not quite yet.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.180
We have to cross the wall here.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.340
Wall?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.020
What's that blue thing?

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:27.940
-That's the wall.
-Right.

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.740
To be exact,
this is where another island begins.

00:07:33.240 --> 00:07:36.280
There it is. It's still intact.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:42.870
Seems safe for a while.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:44.380
Then let's go.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.800
All right. Off we go!

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.050
This time, we won't let them
get us that easily.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.970
She said someone always dies...

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:57.720
Does that mean
it's going to get really dangerous?

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:10.110
See? See?

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.370
There's Island Two.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:31.760
It hasn't changed much here.

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:33.680
No water here, either.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.590
Yeah, we already collected it.

00:08:36.510 --> 00:08:39.010
What's that? Tell me, what is that?

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:46.730
It's like a fish.

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:49.820
Does this tell you where water is?

00:08:49.980 --> 00:08:52.280
-Right.
-It's Ai-chan.

00:08:52.440 --> 00:08:55.910
It tells us how much water
is on this island.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:59.410
We won't be finding any water for a while.

00:08:59.950 --> 00:09:01.660
Island Three is all dry too.

00:09:01.830 --> 00:09:03.660
Let's hope for Island Four.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:07.830
Are you okay, Sis?

00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:10.960
I'm fine.

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:22.680
Don't worry, it just got to me
all of a sudden.

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:24.980
Take it easy, let's rest for a while.

00:09:25.520 --> 00:09:28.270
I'm okay, it's really nothing.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.570
I shouldn't have let you do this
for so long.

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:33.990
I feel bad.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:49.080
I don't hear any big bugs anywhere close.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.880
I don't see any red fog, either.

00:09:52.050 --> 00:09:55.920
-Break time.
-Rest up, Sis Ritsu.

00:09:56.670 --> 00:09:58.760
Sis, drink some more.

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:02.180
I'm fine, my leaves aren't that dry.

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:03.890
I don't want to waste it.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.770
You all have some first.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:11.230
Okay, let's fill up while we can.
You too, Rinas.

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.530
-Yay!
-Yay!

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.030
Let's gulp it down.

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:25.290
That's the stuff.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.370
-Sure is.
-Here, Sis.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:45.430
Come to think of it,
we hadn't had any for a while.

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.230
We can last 10 days on this.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.940
I'm full of energy!

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:51.440
There, we had some. Your turn, Sis.

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.770
Wakaba-kun, you drink some too.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:57.190
I don't know how you work,
but you must need water.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.280
No, I'm fine.

00:10:59.530 --> 00:11:01.070
You must be dry.

00:11:01.740 --> 00:11:03.320
If you insist, Sis.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.620
Thank you.

00:11:12.920 --> 00:11:15.840
This water is so delicious. Thank you.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:19.840
Is that all you need?

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.510
Of course, I'm good now.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:28.600
Rather, you all drink a whole bunch
to last for days, huh?

00:11:30.770 --> 00:11:31.940
Yummy...

00:11:33.440 --> 00:11:34.980
Let's rest up for a while.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.730
I don't see any bugs, but be careful.

00:11:38.780 --> 00:11:40.820
This is so interesting.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.040
Hey, Rinas. Line up.

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:00.550
Rina-san, Rin-san is looking for you.

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:02.260
Where are you?

00:12:03.550 --> 00:12:07.260
Wow, I wonder what this place is.

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:12.520
It looks like both this and Island One
were made for a pretty big population.

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.060
Where have they gone?

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.190
Huh?

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.780
Is the ground shaking?

00:12:23.950 --> 00:12:25.450
I don't feel anything.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.280
I must be imagining it.

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.210
Incredible...

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.130
Ouch!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.090
That totally hurts...

00:12:42.260 --> 00:12:43.420
Hey.

00:12:43.630 --> 00:12:45.260
This isn't snack time.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:49.060
It was a shape we'd never eaten before.

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.890
We had to have a bite.

00:12:55.060 --> 00:12:56.850
He really is fragile.

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.610
So clumsy.

00:12:58.770 --> 00:12:59.980
Kind of like Riku-chan.

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:03.320
Really? She wasn't that clumsy.

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:07.780
I'm glad we found you.
What were you doing?

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:09.160
Having a snack.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:11.330
Gotta fill up when we can.

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:15.710
There.

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:20.460
I really don't get it. But if that's
what you like, I won't stop you.

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:23.720
We need to eat up
and learn lots of things.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:26.430
We feel good when we eat new things.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.140
All of you have those.

00:13:32.390 --> 00:13:33.310
They're leaves.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:36.060
We're fine as long as this is safe.

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:38.400
And another thing...

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:40.570
This is how we duplicate.

00:13:40.730 --> 00:13:44.780
We're going to eat lots of yummies
and make more Rinas.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:46.990
Sis Rin has one too.

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.200
And Ryoku-chan's
and the First Person's too.

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:53.410
It's so pretty.

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:00.920
So tell us if you find something rare.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.340
Something rare?

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.210
Like this?

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:06.760
Good work, Wakaba.

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:11.850
Rinacchi, don't eat what you don't know.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:14.180
Especially not something from him.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:20.650
Are you okay? Does your face feel hot
or is your heart pounding?

00:14:20.810 --> 00:14:23.400
Nope.

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.150
Not at all.

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:28.030
I...I'm sorry.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.950
But wow.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:35.700
This is a strange place.
I wonder what it was for.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:37.120
Really?

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.750
You think the weirdest things.

00:14:40.170 --> 00:14:44.630
I heard there were people
who lived here before us.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:45.840
Wow.

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.630
You heard it from Ryoku-chan?

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:48.720
That's right.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:51.550
Can we walk around a little bit?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:53.970
Just a bit.

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.220
Yay!

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:57.520
Rin-san really spoils her sisters.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.150
Is there anyone else besides you guys?

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.730
Not anymore.

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.610
We've never seen anybody besides us.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:09.900
Then where did I come from?

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:12.870
You're not human. Your blood is red.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.450
You don't have any leaves.

00:15:14.620 --> 00:15:15.870
What are you?

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.540
I'm not sure either.

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:23.000
Since when have you all been here?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.710
We were born on Island One.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:28.300
We were born from the First Person.

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:30.800
Where is that person?

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.970
Dead. Just as we were born.

00:15:36.010 --> 00:15:37.180
We're at the top!

00:15:48.650 --> 00:15:49.650
Huh?

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.540
Found it! I knew it.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:02.420
This is Kemurikusa, right?

00:16:02.710 --> 00:16:04.210
Can I keep it?

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:06.250
He really likes them.

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.880
He can't even use them.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:10.420
But how did you know it was there?

00:16:12.470 --> 00:16:17.470
Look. This one even has a stem. Huh?

00:16:22.060 --> 00:16:24.980
This smell...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.150
You shouldn't eat Kemurikusa
other than from Midori-chan.

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:33.530
It'll get mixed up.

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:37.450
It's good! I thought it was edible.

00:16:37.660 --> 00:16:40.240
I could tell by the smell.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.790
Yummy...

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.620
That does look tasty.

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.080
Can we eat it?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.460
No. You don't know
what Kemurikusa might do to you.

00:16:48.710 --> 00:16:50.090
Only eat Midori's.

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.550
But we want to.

00:16:52.720 --> 00:16:57.300
He said something about smell.
What does he mean?

00:16:57.470 --> 00:16:59.350
Let me see that, Wakaba.

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.930
Rina wants some too.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:03.140
Hey, don't push me!

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.730
Oh well. Let's go back.

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.490
Look, Sis Ritsu.

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:17.200
We found a column
we'd never eaten before.

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:19.240
Good for you.

00:17:23.500 --> 00:17:26.460
Wakaba-kun, you really like Kemurikusa.

00:17:27.580 --> 00:17:28.710
I know!

00:17:30.460 --> 00:17:33.130
Would you like to use this too?

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:36.130
What's that?

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:39.180
We used to use it a long time ago.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.470
It's not glowing now,
but maybe you'll want it.

00:17:44.600 --> 00:17:46.850
It's so big. I can have it?

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.610
Sure.

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:53.780
Ryoku-chan would want you to have it.

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:57.860
You're right.
If it'll lead to a new discovery...

00:17:58.610 --> 00:18:00.620
That's how Ryoku was.

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:04.040
Did this belong to somebody?

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.920
Are you sure?
If that person liked Kemurikusa too...

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.790
Ryoku-chan didn't especially like
Kemurikusa that much.

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.050
Sis Riku liked them more, I'd say.

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:18.050
Those two were always so noisy.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:19.220
Yeah.

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:21.850
Ryoku would get mad when
Riku made them glow.

00:18:22.010 --> 00:18:26.100
That's right. But only Sis Riku
could get them to glow.

00:18:26.270 --> 00:18:30.610
So Ryoku-chan would have to ask her to.
She hated having to do that.

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:36.490
But come to think of it, it's thanks
to Ryoku-chan that we know so much.

00:18:36.820 --> 00:18:40.070
Like how to grow Midori-chan.

00:18:40.740 --> 00:18:45.830
But Ryo-chan would say that
it wasn't fair to fight using Midori-chan.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:48.910
Yeah. She was always like that.

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:52.880
You mean, you used to fight
using only the leaves from the body?

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:54.130
That's right.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.960
Ryo-chan was really good at it.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.930
-That's crazy.
-So stupid.

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:01.090
You're right.

00:19:01.260 --> 00:19:04.140
Okay, let's get going then.

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.930
I'm perfectly fine now, thanks to you.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:09.640
Let's reach Island Three today.

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:11.900
Don't push yourself too hard, Sis.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:15.940
I'm all good.
Let's hop over that other wall.

00:19:22.490 --> 00:19:23.780
What's going on?

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:25.370
It's shaking...?

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:33.750
Wh-What is this? A bug?

00:19:33.960 --> 00:19:37.250
But I don't sense any Red Bugs.
What is this?

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:47.890
Don't worry, the roots are holding on.

00:19:48.060 --> 00:19:49.060
Hang on tight!

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:04.530
Sis!

00:20:26.850 --> 00:20:28.970
Th-That really scared me!

00:20:29.140 --> 00:20:32.850
-It did, the ground shaking like that!
-Yeah!

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.270
I'm so glad you're all safe.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:37.440
It was a close one for Wakaba.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:38.650
You almost melted.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.860
That...was scary...

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:47.660
Why? Why did you jump?

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:51.620
I didn't think.
I just saw this falling and...

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:58.000
You knew what this is?

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:02.050
No, not really...

00:21:02.420 --> 00:21:05.180
But you seemed to really care for it.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:09.350
It's something really important to you,
isn't it?

00:21:11.140 --> 00:21:13.890
Yes, it's very important.

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:18.860
I don't trust you.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:20.860
I don't, but...

00:21:21.820 --> 00:21:24.030
I thank you for this.

00:21:25.030 --> 00:21:28.490
I'm glad that this is safe.

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.960
I didn't think you were the type
to say thanks.

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:41.090
Sorry, it was just unexpected.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:46.010
Thank you for saving me.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:49.890
Let me know if there's anything I can do.

00:21:53.430 --> 00:21:55.680
What...be quiet!

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:58.850
One wrong move, and I'm exterminating you!

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.270
Rina, keep an eye on him.

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.360
Is that the poison acting up?

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:07.660
-Poison, huh?
-Yeah.

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.780
What's this?
